    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345470/extras/4b8508527f476951f9c090a4dbe11e5c.avif?t=1744630302\" /></span><br><strong>Grab your backpacks and travel across Europe!</strong><br>Take a relaxing and exciting journey across Europe in this hidden object game! Explore 30 amazing locations, from the Eiffel Tower in Paris to the Colosseum in Rome.<br>Collect postcards and diamonds as you find hidden objects in each scene. The peaceful atmospheres and calming music will help you relax and enjoy your trip.<br><strong>Features</strong><br>Explore 30 beautiful locations across Europe<br>Collect postcards and diamonds as you find hidden objects<br>Relaxing atmospheres and calming music<br>Multiple game modes to challenge your skills<br>Hours of fun for hidden object game fans of all ages<br>Pet Shop and Postcard Collection<br>Suitable for both kids and adults",
